{%- comment -%}
  Certificates of authenticity for paid orders: one card per certified item,
  showing what it is, its serial, when the customer took ownership, and the
  state of its on-chain token.

  Data:
  - Product metafield duet.authenticity_enabled (true/false): the product
    comes with a certificate.
  - Order metafield duet.authenticity (JSON list), written by the
    authenticity app once a token is minted. Each entry:
      line_item_id, unit, product_title, variant_title, serial, edition,
      status (minting | ready | transferring | in_wallet | revoked), token_id, chain,
      contract, explorer_url, image, purchased_at, minted_at, holder,
      transfer_url
  A paid order's certified items with no entry yet show as "Being minted".

  Accepts:
  - orders: {Array} orders to list (e.g. customer.orders)
  - order: {Object} a single order, instead of orders
  - heading: {String} optional heading

  Usage:
  {% render 'authenticity-certificates', orders: customer.orders, heading: 'Certificates of authenticity' %}
  {% render 'authenticity-certificates', order: order %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign date_format = '%B %-d, %Y · %-I:%M %p %Z'
-%}
{%- capture cards -%}
  {%- for o in orders -%}
    {%- render 'authenticity-order-cards', o: o, date_format: date_format -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if order -%}
    {%- render 'authenticity-order-cards', o: order, date_format: date_format -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- if cards contains 'authenticity-card' -%}
  {{ 'component-authenticity.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <section class="authenticity" id="certificates" aria-labelledby="AuthenticityHeading">
    <h2 class="authenticity__heading" id="AuthenticityHeading">
      {{- heading | default: 'Certificates of authenticity' -}}
    </h2>
    <p class="authenticity__intro">
      Each certified piece comes with a digital certificate recorded on the blockchain. It proves the piece is
      authentic and that you own it, from the moment you paid for it.
    </p>
    <ul class="authenticity__list" role="list">
      {{ cards }}
    </ul>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
